  "statuteText": "260:4 Responsibility for Registration of Boats and Motor Carriers. –\n\nThose powers, duties, functions and personnel, relating to the registration of boats and motors, motor carriers of property and motor carriers of passengers, shall be within the division as provided in RSA 106-A:12."
